# Storage directory placeholder.
# This directory holds encrypted files at rest.
#
# Files are stored using a sharded layout keyed by a hash/UUID prefix, e.g.:
#   encrypted/
#       2f/
#           2f3a95b8.enc
#       1a/
#           1a7e3f91.enc
#
# Original filenames are NEVER used on disk. Metadata (including the original
# name) is stored in PostgreSQL. This directory is mounted inside Docker.
